#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:182
msgid ""
"Configure the AI provider and the prompt used when answering visitors with "
"site search results."
msgstr ""
"AI プロバイダーと、サイト検索結果をもとに訪問者へ回答する際のプロンプトを設定"
"します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:186
msgid "AI Provider"
msgstr "AI プロバイダー"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:212
msgid "Connection Status"
msgstr "接続状況"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:213
msgid ""
"AI provider connections (API keys) are managed centrally in Settings > "
"Connectors, shared by every compatible plugin. This screen only controls "
"which connected provider and model this chatbot uses."
msgstr ""
"AI プロバイダーの接続(API キー)は設定 > コネクタで一元管理され、対応する全プ"
"ラグインで共有されます。この画面では、接続済みのどのプロバイダーとモデルをこ"
"のチャットボットが使うかのみを設定します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:220
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "接続済み"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:222
msgid "Provider plugin not active"
msgstr "プロバイダープラグインが未有効化"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:224
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "未接続"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:236
msgid "Model"
msgstr "モデル"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:240
msgid "The AI model to use for generating answers."
msgstr "回答生成に使用する AI モデルです。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:244
msgid "Validate Connection and Model"
msgstr "接続とモデルを検証"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:248
msgid "Admin Chat Test"
msgstr "管理画面チャットテスト"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:249
msgid ""
"Test a real chatbot reply in the admin screen with the connected provider, "
"model, and system prompt before exposing it publicly."
msgstr ""
"公開前に、接続済みのプロバイダー・モデル・システムプロンプトを使って管理画面"
"で実際のチャットボット応答をテストします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:250
msgid "Enter a sample visitor question to test the chatbot."
msgstr "チャットボットを試すための訪問者向け質問例を入力してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:252
msgid "Run Admin Chat Test"
msgstr "管理画面チャットテストを実行"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:261
msgid "System Prompt"
msgstr "システムプロンプト"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:264
msgid "The system prompt that instructs the AI on how to behave."
msgstr "AI の振る舞いを指示するシステムプロンプトです。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:268
msgid "Maximum Sources"
msgstr "最大ソース数"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:271
msgid "Maximum number of search results to use as sources."
msgstr "ソースとして使用する検索結果の最大件数です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:275
msgid "AI Reply Limit (10 minutes)"
msgstr "AI 応答上限（10 分）"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:278
msgid ""
"Limit the number of AI replies allowed from the same connection within 10 "
"minutes. Normal short conversations should still pass, while repeated trial-"
"and-error questions are switched to site-search-based guidance only. A "
"practical starting point is around 6 to 10."
msgstr ""
"同一接続から 10 分以内に許可する AI 応答回数を制限します。通常の短いやり取り"
"はそのまま通しつつ、試行錯誤的な質問の繰り返しはサイト内検索ベースの案内のみ"
"に切り替えます。初期目安は 6 回から 10 回程度です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:282
msgid "AI Reply Limit (1 hour)"
msgstr "AI 応答上限（1 時間）"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:285
msgid ""
"Cap the total AI replies allowed from the same connection within 1 hour. Use "
"this to suppress prolonged back-and-forth play while keeping normal customer "
"use available. Set this higher than the 10-minute limit; a practical "
"starting point is around 20 to 40."
msgstr ""
"同一接続から 1 時間以内に許可する AI 応答の合計回数を制限します。通常の利用は"
"維持しつつ、長時間のやり取りによる過剰利用を抑えるために使います。10 分上限よ"
"り大きい値に設定し、初期目安は 20 回から 40 回程度です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:289
msgid "AI Reply Limit (site-wide, daily)"
msgstr "AI 返信上限(サイト全体・日次)"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:292
msgid ""
"Hard ceiling on the total number of AI provider calls made across the whole "
"site each day, regardless of visitor IP. This is the main protection against "
"runaway API costs from distributed or automated abuse. Set 0 to disable the "
"cap (not recommended for public sites)."
msgstr ""
"訪問者の IP に関係なく、サイト全体で 1 日に行われる AI プロバイダー呼び出しの"
"総数に設ける上限です。IP 分散または自動化された濫用による API コストの暴走を"
"防ぐ、主要な防御策です。0 を指定すると上限を無効化します(公開サイトでは非推奨"
"です)。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:296
msgid "Trust Proxy Headers"
msgstr "プロキシヘッダーを信頼する"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:300
msgid ""
"This site sits behind a trusted reverse proxy or CDN (e.g. Cloudflare, "
"nginx, a load balancer)."
msgstr ""
"このサイトは信頼できるリバースプロキシまたは CDN(Cloudflare、nginx、ロードバ"
"ランサーなど)の配下にあります。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:302
msgid ""
"When enabled, the visitor IP used for rate limiting is read from forwarded "
"headers (CF-Connecting-IP, X-Real-IP, X-Forwarded-For). Only enable this if "
"a trusted proxy sets those headers; otherwise visitors could spoof them to "
"bypass rate limits. Leave disabled if visitors connect directly to WordPress."
msgstr ""
"有効にすると、レート制限に使用する訪問者 IP を転送ヘッダー(CF-Connecting-IP、"
"X-Real-IP、X-Forwarded-For)から取得します。これらのヘッダーを設定する信頼でき"
"るプロキシがある場合のみ有効にしてください。そうでない場合、訪問者がヘッダー"
"を偽装してレート制限を回避できてしまいます。訪問者が WordPress に直接接続する"
"場合は無効のままにしてください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:306
msgid "Chatbot Display"
msgstr "チャットボット表示"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:310
msgid "Enable chatbot display on the public site"
msgstr "公開サイトでチャットボットを表示する"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:312
msgid ""
"The chatbot is not shown on the public site until this setting is enabled."
msgstr "この設定を有効にするまで、チャットボットは公開サイトに表示されません。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:316
msgid "Display Location"
msgstr "表示場所"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:331
msgid "Saved Knowledge Reuse"
msgstr "保存用ナレッジの再利用"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:335
msgid ""
"Enable approved saved knowledge entries before generating a new AI answer."
msgstr "新しい AI 回答を生成する前に、承認済みの保存用ナレッジを利用します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:337
msgid "Saved knowledge is managed separately from public chat logs."
msgstr "保存用ナレッジは公開チャットログとは別に管理されます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:341
msgid "Knowledge Candidate Drafts"
msgstr "ナレッジ候補ドラフト"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:345
msgid ""
"Allow AI-generated generalized knowledge candidates to be saved as drafts "
"for admin review."
msgstr ""
"AI が生成した一般化ナレッジ候補を、管理者確認用のドラフトとして保存できるよう"
"にします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:350
msgid "Knowledge Match Mode"
msgstr "ナレッジ一致判定モード"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:365
msgid "Knowledge Candidate TTL (hours)"
msgstr "ナレッジ候補 TTL（時間）"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:368
msgid ""
"How long auto-generated draft candidates remain eligible before they should "
"be reviewed or regenerated."
msgstr ""
"自動生成されたドラフト候補を、確認または再生成が必要になるまで有効とみなす時"
"間です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:372
msgid "Uninstall Data Policy"
msgstr "アンインストール時のデータポリシー"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:387
msgid "Chatbot Design"
msgstr "チャットボットデザイン"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:394
msgid ""
"Choose the floating chatbot design shown at the bottom right of the public "
"site."
msgstr ""
"公開サイトの右下に表示するフローティングチャットボットのデザインを選択しま"
"す。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:404
msgid "Saved Knowledge Management"
msgstr "保存用ナレッジ管理"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:405
msgid ""
"Review generalized question and answer pairs, manage approval status, and "
"export or import CSV data from the dedicated Saved Knowledge Base screen."
msgstr ""
"一般化した質問と回答のペアを確認し、承認状態を管理し、専用の保存用ナレッジ画"
"面から CSV のエクスポートとインポートを行います。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:406
msgid "Open Saved Knowledge Base"
msgstr "保存用ナレッジを開く"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:432
msgid "Knowledge Base Editors"
msgstr "ナレッジ編集者"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:433
msgid ""
"Grant users who are not administrators access to create and edit entries on "
"the Saved Knowledge Base screen only. Deleting entries and CSV import/export "
"remain administrator-only actions."
msgstr ""
"管理者ではないユーザーに、保存用ナレッジ画面でのエントリーの作成と編集のみを"
"許可します。削除や CSV のインポート/エクスポートは引き続き管理者専用の操作の"
"ままです。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot-admin.php:450
msgid "— Administrator (full access)"
msgstr "— 管理者（フルアクセス）"

